{"name": "Night Machine", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras_big/b4a2ffcc85cfe055084491b6f974413d.webp?t=1787777709\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/b4a2ffcc85cfe055084491b6f974413d.avif?t=1787777709\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hello, trainee.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By now you're probably aware that the Moon has experienced a \"catastrophic incident.\" It turns out there's been a <strong>gigantic alien machine</strong> hiding in there, which is awake now, and we're <i>really</i> not too happy about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"292\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.poster.avif?t=1787777709\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.webm?t=1787777709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/4b70c6c49c7516684eea8506e80543ef.mp4?t=1787777709\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras_big/0ba2618ee4a97ca02bf7b188c0ed8cf0.webp?t=1787777709\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/0ba2618ee4a97ca02bf7b188c0ed8cf0.avif?t=1787777709\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is to enter the Moon, make your way to its core, and shut it down permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"292\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.poster.avif?t=1787777709\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.webm?t=1787777709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/fb38d16f9a8a0af6c97b15ae6a54a916.mp4?t=1787777709\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an entry-level position. For your convenience, your ship has been equipped with our latest <strong>card interface</strong>. Simply feed instructions into the onboard computer and it'll execute them, no experience necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You'll be fine!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or maybe not. We really can't say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've prepared a much longer briefing, but in the interest of time... we're just going to let you get in there and figure it out yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras_big/122109bf6c20192a046338b207911c3d.webp?t=1787777709\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/122109bf6c20192a046338b207911c3d.avif?t=1787777709\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>We're all counting on you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"292\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/5ddc6ae16b63a19845d0947f9262da9d.poster.avif?t=1787777709\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/5ddc6ae16b63a19845d0947f9262da9d.webm?t=1787777709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/5ddc6ae16b63a19845d0947f9262da9d.mp4?t=1787777709\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras_big/d9f43dc0528cf12b69dd81e8cb06ffb8.webp?t=1787777709\" height=\"439\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/d9f43dc0528cf12b69dd81e8cb06ffb8.avif?t=1787777709\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More stuff you might want to know about:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Real-time Card Battles:</strong> Play cards in the moment, using your reflexes to take advantage of timing-based effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Card Management:</strong> Manage your hand, keeping the cards you need from getting discarded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Patch Card system:</strong> Modify cards on the fly for high-reward combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple ships:</strong> Each with distinct loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite progression:</strong> Unlock new ships and ship mods across runs  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "We\u2019ve just learned the Moon is a giant alien doomsday factory, which is kind of a bummer. You've been chosen to operate a spaceship into the core and destroy it for us. Think fast, adapt under pressure, and deploy powerful combinations as you fight your way through in this real-time card battler.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/4d4b5746917f5de10a9c4397c757bffb05eff0fc/header.jpg?t=1787777709", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Real-Time", "Difficult", "Sci-fi", "Deckbuilding", "Strategy"], "developers": "Cooler Game Studios", "publishers": "Cooler Game Studios", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2974540", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "29 August 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/4LQrY2Cy8ww", "first_seen": 1756418400.0, "review_rank": 1504}